            {
              "reviewer": "Suzy",
              "rating": 5,
              "title": "Very happy with this",
              "body": "The quality of this little vacuum sealer is great. It seals the reusable bags tightly so food stays fresh way longer. The fact that the bags are reusable was a huge selling point for me, no more wasting money on disposable bags or throwing away food due to freezer burn. It’s super simple to use, easy to clean and the compact design allows it to be stored anywhere or transported easily. Very happy with this purchase!",
